Third-party code
----------------

The `engine/` directory is NOT part of Oribots' own code. It is a vendored copy
of Revolve2 (version 1.2.0), the modular-robot simulation framework by the
CI Group, redistributed here so the repository is self-contained.

    Revolve2 - https://github.com/ci-group/revolve2
    Licensed under the GNU Lesser General Public License v3 (LGPLv3).
    See engine/LICENSE for the full license text, and engine/PATCHES.md for the
    handful of documented changes made to the vendored copy.

Because Oribots vendors LGPLv3 code, Oribots' own code is likewise released
under the LGPLv3 (see LICENSE), which keeps the combined work simple to
redistribute. The distinction is only relevant to attribution: the six
Revolve2 packages under `engine/` are the CI Group's work; everything outside
`engine/` is Oribots' own.
